{"strongs": "H8033", "word": "שָׁם", "translit": "sham", "root": "שלש", "morph": "H:Adv", "pos": "adverb", "gloss": "there, thither", "definition": "שָׁם adverb there, thither (Arabic there , compare then ; Biblical Aramaic תַּמָּה , Egyptian Aramaic תמה S-C Pap. A 4, J 6 , ᵑ7 תַּמָּן (with demonstrative n , compare אֱדַיִן beside אֲזַי ), Syriac ; Zenj Had. 8 ( Cooke 159 ) שם ); — 1. a. there Gen 2:8 ; Gen 2:12 ; Gen 11:2 ; Gen 11:7 ; Gen 11:31 + often; placed early in sentence for emphasis, Mic 4:10 שָׁם תִּנָּצֵ֑לִי , Nah 3:15 ; Ezek 32:22 ; Ezek 32:24 ; Ps 104:26 +, וְשָׁם ֗֗֗ Gen 41:12 ; Exod 15:27 ; Num 13:22 ; Num 13:33 +, שָׁם ֗֗֗ וְשָׁם Exod 15:25 ; Deut 12:14 ; Isa 27:10 ; Job 3:17 +, וְהִנֵּה שָׁם ֗֗֗ Gen 29:2 , כִּי שָׁם ֗֗֗ Gen 11:9 ; Gen 21:31 ; Gen 35:7 ; 2Sam 1:21 ; 2Sam 15:21 +, אַךְ שָׁם ֗֗֗ Isa 34:14 ; Isa 34:15 , גַּם שָׁם ֗֗֗ Isa 23:12 ; Isa 57:7 ; Ps 139:10 resuming a preceding 'where,' Job 39:30 בַּאֲשֶׁר חֲלָלִים שָׁם הוּא , Judg 5:27 ; Jer 22:12 ; Eccl 11:3 , compare Eccl 1:7 . Repeated, שָׁם ֗֗֗ שָׁם here ... there Isa 28:10 ; Isa 28:13 . In poetry, pointing to a spot in which a scene is localized vividly in the imagination, Ps 14:5 שׁם פחדו פחד there feared they a fear! Ps 36:13 , compare Ps 48:7 ; Ps 66:6 ; Ps 132:17 ; Hos 6:7 ; Zeph 1:14 . — Hab 3:4 read probably ( We Now ) שָׂם the flashes at his side made he the hiding of his power; Eccl 3:17 שָׁם = with God , in the Divine plan or scheme: but read perhaps שָׂם Hi De and others \\ \\ b. preceded by the rel., אֲשֶׁר שָׁם where , Gen 2:11 ; Exod 20:21 ; 1Sam 9:10 +, usually with one or more words between, Gen 13:3 ; Gen 13:14 ; Gen 19:27 ; Exod 29:42 ; 2Sam 11:16 ; 2Kgs 23:27 + often; after בַּאֲשֶׁר , בַּאֲשֶׁר הוּא שָׁם Gen 21:17 . With אשׁר omitted (the relative being indicated by construct, Ges «GKC:130c»§ 130 c, d ) Ezek 39:11 מְקוֺם שָׁם קֶבֶר ׳ בְּיִשְׂר a place where a grave (may be) in Israel, but ᵐ5 ᵑ7 Co Or and others read שֵׁם a place of renown. 2. thither , after verbs of motion ( = שָׁ֫מָּה , see 3 ), Deut 1:37 לֹא תָבאֹ שָׁם , Judg 19:15 ; Judg 21:10 ; 1Sam 2:14 ; 1Sam 9:6 and elsewhere; אֲשֶׁר ֗֗֗ שָׁם whither , 1Kgs 18:10 ; 1Kgs 21:18 ; 2Kgs 1:4 ; 2Kgs 1:6 ; 2Kgs 1:16 ; Isa 20:6 , more often in Jeremiah, Ezekiel, as Jer 8:3 ; Jer 22:27 ; Jer 23:3 ; Jer 23:8 ; Jer 45:5 +, Ezek 4:13 ; Ezek 12:16 ; Ezek 36:20 ; Ezek 36:22 +; so שֶׁשָּׁם Ps 122:4 . 3. with ה locative, שָׁ֫מָּה ( sh¹mm¹h ): \\ \\ a. after verbs of motion, thither , Gen 19:20 לָנוּס שָׁ֫מָּה to flee thither , v Gen 19:22 ; Gen 20:13 ; Gen 24:6 ; Gen 29:3 ; Deut 1:38 + often; = into it, therein (of a basket, pit, etc.), Exod 16:33 וְתֶןשָֿׁ֫מָּה מְלֹא הָעֹמֶר , Exod 21:33 וְנָפַל שָׁמָּה , Exod 30:18 ; Judg 8:25 ; 2Kgs 12:10 pregnantly, after a verb implying motion, as to bury , Gen 23:13 וְאֶקְבְּרָה אֶתמֵֿתִי שָׁ֫מָּה , Gen 25:10 ; Gen 49:31 ; Gen 50:5 (all P ), נוֺעַד to meet Exod 29:42 ; Exod 29:43 ; Exod 30:6 ; Exod 30:36 ; Num 17:19 (all P ), Josh 2:16 ; Josh 7:3 ; Jer 13:7 ; Joel 4:7 , perhaps Song 8:5 (? c ). \\ \\ b. אֲשֶׁר ֗֗֗ שָׁ֫מָּה whither Gen 20:13 ; Num 33:54 ; Deut 4:5 ; Deut 4:14 + often; where 2Kgs 23:8 ; 1Chr 4:41 . \\ \\ c. more rarely, i. q. שָׁם there , Gen 43:30 וַיֵּבְךְ שָׁ֫מָּה , Josh 2:1 ; Judg 16:27 ; 2Kgs 4:11 ; 2Kgs 9:16 ; Hos 2:17 ; Isa 22:18 ; Isa 34:15 ; Isa 65:9 ; Jer 18:2 ; Jer 27:22 ; Ezek 23:3 ; Ezek 32:29 ; Ezek 32:30 ( Ezek 32:22 v Ezek 32:24 v Ezek 32:26 שָׁם ), Ezek 48:35 שָׁ֫מָּה ׳ י , Ps 76:4 ; Ps 122:5 ; Eccl 3:16 . 4. מִשָּׁם from there, thence: \\ \\ a. often after verbs of departing, taking, etc., Gen 2:10 ; Gen 11:8 ; Gen 11:9 ; Gen 12:8 ; Gen 18:16 ; Gen 24:7 ; Gen 42:2 , etc., Num 13:23 ; Num 21:12 ; Num 22:41 וַיַּרְא מִשָּׁם , Deut 4:29 וּבִקַּשְׁתֶּם מִשָּׁם , Deut 30:4 ; Jer 37:12 ; Hos 2:17 ; Amos 9:2 ; Amos 9:3 ; Amos 9:4 ; Job 39:29 +. Peculiarly, Gen 49:24 ׳ מִשָּׁם רֹעֶה אֶבֶן יִשְׂר Ges De RVm from there [from heaven], (from) the Shepherd ( ׳ י ), the Stone (Rock) of Israel, Ew Di Sta from there (where is) the Shepherd of ( רֹעֵה ) the (Bethel-)stone of Israel; but both forced: text dubious; Gunk by the name ( מִשֵּׁם ; so ᵑ6 ) of the Shepherd, etc. (as Ew Di ). \\ \\ b. אֲשֶׁר ֗֗֗ מִשָּׁם whence Gen 24:5 ; Num 23:13 +. \\ \\ c. expressing origin , Gen 3:23 the ground אֲשֶׁר לֻקַּח מִשָּׁם , Gen 10:14 whence (= from whom ) came forth the Philistines, Judg 19:18 מִשָּׁם אָנֹכִי , 1Sam 10:12 אִישׁ מִשָּׁם , Isa 65:20 . \\ \\ d. of the mass, from which something is taken or made, Gen 27:9 ; Gen 30:32 (of צאֹן ), Lev 2:2 ׳ וְקָמַץ מִשָּׁם זגו (from the meal, etc., of a מנחה ), 1Kgs 17:13 אַךְ עֲשִׁי לִי מִשָּׁם עֻגָה קְטַנָּה i.e. from the meal and oil, 2Kgs 7:2 ; 2Kgs 7:19 וּמִשָּׁם לֹא תאֵֹכל׃ , Ezek 5:3 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8775')\">BDB8775</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8033')\">H8033</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H3074')\">H3074</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8774')\">BDB8774</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8776')\">BDB8776</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שָׁם</bdbheb> <b>adverb</b> <highlightword>there, thither</highlightword> (Arabic <placeholder5589/> <highlight>there</highlight>, compare <placeholder5590/> <highlight>then</highlight>; Biblical Aramaic <bdbarc>תַּמָּה</bdbarc>, Egyptian Aramaic <bdbarc>תמה</bdbarc> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('S-C')\">S-C<sup>Pap. A 4, J 6</sup></lookup>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>תַּמָּן</bdbheb> (with demonstrative <highlight>n</highlight>, compare <bdbheb>אֱדַיִן</bdbheb> beside <bdbheb>אֲזַי</bdbheb>), Syriac <placeholder5591/>; Zenj<sup>Had. 8</sup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Cooke')\">Cooke<sup>159</sup></lookup>) <bdbheb>שם</bdbheb>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>1. a.</b> <highlight>there</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 2:8\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(1,2,8)\">Gen 2:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 2:12\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(1,2,12)\">Gen 2:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 11:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,11,2)\">Gen 11:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 11:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,11,7)\">Gen 11:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 11:31\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(1,11,31)\">Gen 11:31</ref> + often; placed early in sentence for emphasis, <ref ref=\"Mic 4:10\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(33,4,10)\">Mic 4:10</ref> <bdbheb>שָׁם תִּנָּצֵ֑לִי</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Nah 3:15\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(34,3,15)\">Nah 3:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 32:22\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(26,32,22)\">Ezek 32:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 32:24\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(26,32,24)\">Ezek 32:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 104:26\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"104\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"104\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(19,104,26)\">Ps 104:26</ref> +, <bdbheb>וְשָׁם ֗֗֗ </bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 41:12\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,12)\">Gen 41:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 15:27\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(2,15,27)\">Exod 15:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 13:22\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(4,13,22)\">Num 13:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 13:33\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(4,13,33)\">Num 13:33</ref> +, <bdbheb>שָׁם ֗֗֗ וְשָׁם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 15:25\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(2,15,25)\">Exod 15:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 12:14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,12,14)\">Deut 12:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 27:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,27,10)\">Isa 27:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 3:17\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(18,3,17)\">Job 3:17</ref> +, <bdbheb>וְהִנֵּה שָׁם ֗֗֗ </bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 29:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,29,2)\">Gen 29:2</ref>, <bdbheb>כִּי שָׁם ֗֗֗ </bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 11:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,11,9)\">Gen 11:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 21:31\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(1,21,31)\">Gen 21:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 35:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,35,7)\">Gen 35:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 1:21\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(10,1,21)\">2Sam 1:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:21\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,21)\">2Sam 15:21</ref> +, <bdbheb>אַךְ שָׁם ֗֗֗ </bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 34:14\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(23,34,14)\">Isa 34:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 34:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,34,15)\">Isa 34:15</ref>, <bdbheb>גַּם שָׁם ֗֗֗ </bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 23:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,23,12)\">Isa 23:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 57:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"57\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"57\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,57,7)\">Isa 57:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 139:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"139\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"139\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,139,10)\">Ps 139:10</ref> resuming a preceding 'where,' <ref ref=\"Job 39:30\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(18,39,30)\">Job 39:30</ref> <bdbheb>בַּאֲשֶׁר חֲלָלִים שָׁם הוּא</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Judg 5:27\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,27)\">Judg 5:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 22:12\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(24,22,12)\">Jer 22:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 11:3\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(21,11,3)\">Eccl 11:3</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Eccl 1:7\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(21,1,7)\">Eccl 1:7</ref>. Repeated, <bdbheb>שָׁם ֗֗֗ שָׁם</bdbheb> <highlight>here</highlight> ... <highlight>there</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 28:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,10)\">Isa 28:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 28:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,13)\">Isa 28:13</ref>. In poetry, pointing to a spot in which a scene is localized vividly in the imagination, <ref ref=\"Ps 14:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,14,5)\">Ps 14:5</ref> <bdbheb>שׁם פחדו פחד</bdbheb> <highlight>there</highlight> feared they a fear! <ref ref=\"Ps 36:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,36,13)\">Ps 36:13</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Ps 48:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,48,7)\">Ps 48:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 66:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,66,6)\">Ps 66:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 132:17\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"132\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"132\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(19,132,17)\">Ps 132:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 6:7\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(28,6,7)\">Hos 6:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zeph 1:14\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(36,1,14)\">Zeph 1:14</ref>. — <ref ref=\"Hab 3:4\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(35,3,4)\">Hab 3:4</ref> read probably (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Now')\">Now</lookup>) <bdbheb>שָׂם</bdbheb> the flashes at his side <highlight>made he</highlight> the hiding of his power; <ref ref=\"Eccl 3:17\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(21,3,17)\">Eccl 3:17</ref> <bdbheb>שָׁם</bdbheb> = <highlight>with God</highlight>, in the Divine plan or scheme: but read perhaps <bdbheb>שָׂם</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hi')\">Hi</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup> and others <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> preceded by the rel., <bdbheb>אֲשֶׁר שָׁם</bdbheb> <highlight>where</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Gen 2:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,2,11)\">Gen 2:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 20:21\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(2,20,21)\">Exod 20:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 9:10\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(9,9,10)\">1Sam 9:10</ref> +, usually with one or more words between, <ref ref=\"Gen 13:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,13,3)\">Gen 13:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 13:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,13,14)\">Gen 13:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 19:27\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,27)\">Gen 19:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 29:42\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"42\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"42\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,42)\">Exod 29:42</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 11:16\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(10,11,16)\">2Sam 11:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:27\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,27)\">2Kgs 23:27</ref> + often; after <bdbheb>בַּאֲשֶׁר</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>בַּאֲשֶׁר הוּא שָׁם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 21:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,21,17)\">Gen 21:17</ref>. With <bdbheb>אשׁר</bdbheb> omitted (the relative being indicated by construct, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:130c»§ 130 c, d</sup>) <ref ref=\"Ezek 39:11\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(26,39,11)\">Ezek 39:11</ref> <bdbheb>מְקוֺם שָׁם קֶבֶר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בְּיִשְׂר</bdbheb> a place <highlight>where</highlight> a grave (may be) in Israel, but <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Or')\">Or</lookup> and others read <bdbheb>שֵׁם</bdbheb> a place of <highlight>renown.</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>thither</highlight>, after verbs of motion ( = <bdbheb>שָׁ֫מָּה</bdbheb>, see <b>3</b>), <ref ref=\"Deut 1:37\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(5,1,37)\">Deut 1:37</ref> <bdbheb>לֹא תָבאֹ שָׁם</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Judg 19:15\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(7,19,15)\">Judg 19:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 21:10\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(7,21,10)\">Judg 21:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:14\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,14)\">1Sam 2:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 9:6\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(9,9,6)\">1Sam 9:6</ref> and elsewhere; <bdbheb>אֲשֶׁר ֗֗֗ שָׁם</bdbheb> <highlight>whither</highlight>, <ref ref=\"1Kgs 18:10\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(11,18,10)\">1Kgs 18:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 21:18\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(11,21,18)\">1Kgs 21:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 1:4\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(12,1,4)\">2Kgs 1:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 1:6\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(12,1,6)\">2Kgs 1:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 1:16\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(12,1,16)\">2Kgs 1:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 20:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,20,6)\">Isa 20:6</ref>, more often in Jeremiah, Ezekiel, as <ref ref=\"Jer 8:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,8,3)\">Jer 8:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 22:27\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(24,22,27)\">Jer 22:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 23:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,3)\">Jer 23:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 23:8\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,8)\">Jer 23:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 45:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,45,5)\">Jer 45:5</ref> +, <ref ref=\"Ezek 4:13\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(26,4,13)\">Ezek 4:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 12:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,12,16)\">Ezek 12:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 36:20\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(26,36,20)\">Ezek 36:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 36:22\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(26,36,22)\">Ezek 36:22</ref> +; so <bdbheb>שֶׁשָּׁם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 122:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"122\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"122\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,122,4)\">Ps 122:4</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> with <bdbheb>ה</bdbheb> locative, <bdbheb>שָׁ֫מָּה</bdbheb> (<transliteration>sh¹mm¹h</transliteration>): <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> after verbs of motion, <highlight>thither</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Gen 19:20\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,20)\">Gen 19:20</ref> <bdbheb>לָנוּס שָׁ֫מָּה</bdbheb> to flee <highlight>thither</highlight>, v<ref ref=\"Gen 19:22\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,22)\">Gen 19:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 20:13\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(1,20,13)\">Gen 20:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 24:6\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,6)\">Gen 24:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 29:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,29,3)\">Gen 29:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 1:38\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(5,1,38)\">Deut 1:38</ref> + often; = <highlight>into it, therein</highlight> (of a basket, pit, etc.), <ref ref=\"Exod 16:33\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(2,16,33)\">Exod 16:33</ref> <bdbheb>וְתֶןשָֿׁ֫מָּה מְלֹא הָעֹמֶר</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Exod 21:33\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(2,21,33)\">Exod 21:33</ref> <bdbheb>וְנָפַל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>שָׁמָּה</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Exod 30:18\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,18)\">Exod 30:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 8:25\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,25)\">Judg 8:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 12:10\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(12,12,10)\">2Kgs 12:10</ref> pregnantly, after a verb implying motion, as <highlight>to bury</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Gen 23:13\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(1,23,13)\">Gen 23:13</ref> <bdbheb>וְאֶקְבְּרָה אֶתמֵֿתִי שָׁ֫מָּה</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Gen 25:10\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(1,25,10)\">Gen 25:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 49:31\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(1,49,31)\">Gen 49:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 50:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,50,5)\">Gen 50:5</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <bdbheb>נוֺעַד</bdbheb> <highlight>to meet</highlight> <ref ref=\"Exod 29:42\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"42\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"42\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,42)\">Exod 29:42</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 29:43\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"43\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"43\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,43)\">Exod 29:43</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 30:6\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,6)\">Exod 30:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 30:36\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,36)\">Exod 30:36</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 17:19\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,19)\">Num 17:19</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Josh 2:16\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(6,2,16)\">Josh 2:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 7:3\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(6,7,3)\">Josh 7:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 13:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,13,7)\">Jer 13:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Joel 4:7\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(29,4,7)\">Joel 4:7</ref>, perhaps <ref ref=\"Song 8:5\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(22,8,5)\">Song 8:5</ref> (? <b>c</b>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <bdbheb>אֲשֶׁר ֗֗֗ שָׁ֫מָּה</bdbheb> <highlight>whither</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 20:13\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(1,20,13)\">Gen 20:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 33:54\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"54\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"54\" onclick=\"bcv(4,33,54)\">Num 33:54</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 4:5\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,5)\">Deut 4:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 4:14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,14)\">Deut 4:14</ref> + often; <highlight>where</highlight> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:8\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,8)\">2Kgs 23:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 4:41\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(13,4,41)\">1Chr 4:41</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> more rarely, i. q. <bdbheb>שָׁם</bdbheb> <highlight>there</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Gen 43:30\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(1,43,30)\">Gen 43:30</ref> <bdbheb>וַיֵּבְךְ שָׁ֫מָּה</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Josh 2:1\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(6,2,1)\">Josh 2:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 16:27\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,27)\">Judg 16:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 4:11\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(12,4,11)\">2Kgs 4:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 9:16\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(12,9,16)\">2Kgs 9:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 2:17\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(28,2,17)\">Hos 2:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 22:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,22,18)\">Isa 22:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 34:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,34,15)\">Isa 34:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 65:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"65\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"65\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,65,9)\">Isa 65:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 18:2\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(24,18,2)\">Jer 18:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 27:22\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(24,27,22)\">Jer 27:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 23:3\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(26,23,3)\">Ezek 23:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 32:29\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(26,32,29)\">Ezek 32:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 32:30\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(26,32,30)\">Ezek 32:30</ref> (<ref ref=\"Ezek 32:22\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(26,32,22)\">Ezek 32:22</ref> v<ref ref=\"Ezek 32:24\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(26,32,24)\">Ezek 32:24</ref> v<ref ref=\"Ezek 32:26\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(26,32,26)\">Ezek 32:26</ref> <bdbheb>שָׁם</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ezek 48:35\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(26,48,35)\">Ezek 48:35</ref> <bdbheb>שָׁ֫מָּה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ps 76:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"76\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"76\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,76,4)\">Ps 76:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 122:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"122\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"122\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,122,5)\">Ps 122:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 3:16\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(21,3,16)\">Eccl 3:16</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <bdbheb>מִשָּׁם</bdbheb> <highlight>from there, thence:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> often after verbs of departing, taking, etc., <ref ref=\"Gen 2:10\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(1,2,10)\">Gen 2:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 11:8\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(1,11,8)\">Gen 11:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 11:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,11,9)\">Gen 11:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 12:8\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(1,12,8)\">Gen 12:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 18:16\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,16)\">Gen 18:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 24:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,7)\">Gen 24:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 42:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,42,2)\">Gen 42:2</ref>, etc., <ref ref=\"Num 13:23\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(4,13,23)\">Num 13:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 21:12\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(4,21,12)\">Num 21:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 22:41\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(4,22,41)\">Num 22:41</ref> <bdbheb>וַיַּרְא מִשָּׁם</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Deut 4:29\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,29)\">Deut 4:29</ref> <bdbheb>וּבִקַּשְׁתֶּם מִשָּׁם</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Deut 30:4\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(5,30,4)\">Deut 30:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 37:12\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(24,37,12)\">Jer 37:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 2:17\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(28,2,17)\">Hos 2:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 9:2\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(30,9,2)\">Amos 9:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 9:3\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(30,9,3)\">Amos 9:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 9:4\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(30,9,4)\">Amos 9:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 39:29\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(18,39,29)\">Job 39:29</ref> +. Peculiarly, <ref ref=\"Gen 49:24\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(1,49,24)\">Gen 49:24</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִשָּׁם רֹעֶה אֶבֶן יִשְׂר</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('RV')\"><reflink>RVm</reflink></lookup> <highlight>from there</highlight> [from heaven], (from) the Shepherd (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>), the Stone (Rock) of Israel, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sta')\">Sta</lookup> <highlight>from there</highlight> (where is) the Shepherd of (<bdbheb>רֹעֵה</bdbheb>) the (Bethel-)stone of Israel; but both forced: text dubious; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gunk')\">Gunk</lookup> by the name (<bdbheb>מִשֵּׁם</bdbheb>; so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Syr')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ6</reflink></bdbheb></lookup>) of the Shepherd, etc. (as <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <bdbheb>אֲשֶׁר ֗֗֗ מִשָּׁם</bdbheb> <highlight>whence</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 24:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,5)\">Gen 24:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 23:13\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(4,23,13)\">Num 23:13</ref> +. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> expressing <highlight>origin</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Gen 3:23\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(1,3,23)\">Gen 3:23</ref> the ground <bdbheb>אֲשֶׁר לֻקַּח</bdbheb> <bdbheb>מִשָּׁם</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Gen 10:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,10,14)\">Gen 10:14</ref> <highlight>whence</highlight> (= <highlight>from whom</highlight>) came forth the Philistines, <ref ref=\"Judg 19:18\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(7,19,18)\">Judg 19:18</ref> <bdbheb>מִשָּׁם אָנֹכִי</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:12\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,12)\">1Sam 10:12</ref> <bdbheb>אִישׁ מִשָּׁם</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Isa 65:20\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"65\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"65\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(23,65,20)\">Isa 65:20</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> of the mass, <highlight>from</highlight> which something is taken or made, <ref ref=\"Gen 27:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,27,9)\">Gen 27:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 30:32\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(1,30,32)\">Gen 30:32</ref> (of <bdbheb>צאֹן</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Lev 2:2\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(3,2,2)\">Lev 2:2</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וְקָמַץ מִשָּׁם זגו</bdbheb> (from the meal, etc., of a <bdbheb>מנחה</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"1Kgs 17:13\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(11,17,13)\">1Kgs 17:13</ref> <bdbheb>אַךְ עֲשִׁי לִי מִשָּׁם עֻגָה קְטַנָּה</bdbheb> i.e. from the meal and oil, <ref ref=\"2Kgs 7:2\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(12,7,2)\">2Kgs 7:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 7:19\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(12,7,19)\">2Kgs 7:19</ref> <bdbheb>וּמִשָּׁם לֹא תאֵֹכל׃</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ezek 5:3\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(26,5,3)\">Ezek 5:3</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 2:8", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 2, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Gen 2:12", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 2, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Gen 11:2", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 11, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Gen 11:7", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 11, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Gen 11:31", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 11, "verse": 31}, {"raw": "Mic 4:10", "book": "MIC", "chapter": 4, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Nah 3:15", "book": "NAM", "chapter": 3, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Ezek 32:22", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 32, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Ezek 32:24", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 32, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Ps 104:26", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 104, "verse": 26}, {"raw": "Gen 41:12", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 41, "verse": 